---
// Full-bleed Sanctuary architectural photograph & Final Invitation in Tengile MalaMala style
---

<section class="relative min-h-[75vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden py-32 bg-[var(--tm-dark)]">
  <!-- Full-bleed background image -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img
      src="/images/sanctuary.jpg"
      alt="Arsitektur musholla yang tenang dan agung"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center filter brightness-[0.4] contrast-[1.1] scale-105"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--tm-dark)] via-[var(--tm-dark)]/40 to-[var(--tm-dark)] pointer-events-none"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content Layer -->
  <div class="container-tm relative z-10 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
    <span class="suptitle-tm">Amanah &bull; Ibadah &bull; Ketenangan</span>
    
    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-normal text-white leading-tight uppercase mb-8">
      Hadirkan Manajemen Pengajian yang Tertib &amp;<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
      <span class="italic font-light text-[var(--tm-stone)]">Menenangkan Hati</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--tm-stone)]/90 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
      Ucapkan selamat tinggal pada buku absen basah dan lembar setoran yang tercecer. Berikan orang tua santri ketenangan hati dengan rekapitulasi capaian tilawah yang rapi, transparan, dan siap cetak.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="#demo" class="btn-pill btn-pill-light w-full sm:w-auto text-xs tracking-[0.16em]">
        <span>Mulai Simulasi Sistem</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#spesifikasi" class="btn-pill btn-pill-outline w-full sm:w-auto text-xs tracking-[0.16em]">
        <span>Spesifikasi Rekayasa</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-8 text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--tm-stone)]/60 font-sans">
      <span>PWA Layar Penuh Mandiri</span>
      <span>&bull;</span>
      <span>IndexedDB Offline</span>
      <span>&bull;</span>
      <span>Ekspor PDF A4 Landscape</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
